### Search - any vehicle, any trip type
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/trip-search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickup": { "description": "Bhubaneswar Airport", "latitude": 20.2444, "longitude": 85.8178 },
  "destination": { "description": "Puri", "latitude": 19.8135, "longitude": 85.8312 },
  "stops": [],
  "startDate": "2026-08-30",
  "endDate": "2026-08-30",
  "passengerCount": 4
}

### Search - SUV, one way only
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/trip-search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickup": { "description": "Bhubaneswar Airport", "latitude": 20.2444, "longitude": 85.8178 },
  "destination": { "description": "Puri", "latitude": 19.8135, "longitude": 85.8312 },
  "stops": [
    { "description": "Konark", "latitude": 19.8876, "longitude": 86.0945 }
  ],
  "startDate": "2026-08-30",
  "endDate": "2026-08-30",
  "passengerCount": 6,
  "vehicleCategory": "SUV",
  "tripType": "CHAUFFEUR_ONE_WAY"
}

### Search - pickup outside every service area (expect empty list)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/trip-search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickup": { "description": "Delhi", "latitude": 28.6139, "longitude": 77.2090 },
  "destination": { "description": "Agra", "latitude": 27.1767, "longitude": 78.0081 },
  "startDate": "2026-08-30",
  "endDate": "2026-08-30",
  "passengerCount": 4
}

